      "writtenOn": "2025-10-24T14:03:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we never support editing with path data, do we want the converse also (or maybe exclusively)?\n\n```\n#if defined(SK_PATH_USES_PATHDATA) \u0026\u0026 !defined(SK_HIDE_PATH_EDIT_METHODS)\n    #define SK_HIDE_PATH_EDIT_METHODS\n#endif\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "5d15444797833cfc9cad8fd62d200654aee81292",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
