        "id": 5648
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-24T15:06:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can shuffle this to whatever makes sense for a client to set -- in my mind, the only \"client\" decision is : am I using SkPath-editing APIs or not.\n\nOur internal choice is: given we\u0027re in a non-editing mode, which backend impl do we want to use/test.",
      "parentUuid": "3884eeff_0b1b9252",
